  "scope": "D325 lossless distance-origin packing: compact labels store distance-base+1; get returns exact absolute64-bit distance. Wide map remains exact absolute fallback for below-base/out-of-range/full-bucket/wide-node. If an existing packed key is improved below base, cold unbias merges every packed absolute value into the exact wide map, clears all compact slots and retries at base0, preserving general map semantics, no hidden lower-bound precondition. Query initializes base only from timed actual minimum outgoing/reverse-incoming weight for bounded<=16-degree endpoints and only if min>UINT32_MAX/2; otherwise0. Threshold/degree cap are storage/work choices only, never answer cutoffs. Heaps, edge weights, bidirectional32/band64/stale checks/output remain ABSOLUTE and unchanged. Added normal-origin arithmetic/adjacency scan/source can lose; no memory/time/K promise. Requires fresh arbitrary-base/stdmap/decrease/cross-underflow/unbias/grow/wide/SIMD/full64/overflow/reset/strict/race/Floyd/current-main/pinnedGCC/image/default/all29 proof if native supports. No seed recognition, cached answers, imported source, host/counter/exemption changes.",
